ld to finally come  together in one piece as well there is a  reason why the poneglyphs contain  important information about the ancient  weapons  those who created the poneglyphs had  limited space and they used it to leave  only the most important messages to the  future generations and yet they chose to  spend a lot of space focusing on the  three ancient weapons that is not a  coincidence it is because the ancient  weapons will turn out to be  indispensable in the fight against the  world government and this will become  more and more clear as the final saga  unfolds  even if luffy leaves wano without  awakening pluton because he doesn't care  about it someone will definitely awaken  it before the final battle someone like  sabo vivi shirahoshi dragon or all of  them together and when that happens  pluton and poseidon will make their way  to the site of the final battle where  luffy and the straw hats will also be  waiting uranus will be there as well  either in the form of the nika devil  fruit or in whatever form it turns out  to be in and this is how one piece will  end the red line will be destroyed or at  least the part of it around marijua the  fishman will evacuate to the surface  inside the noaa the world will be united  in one piece and a giant party will  ensue across the entire  all blue this is my prediction and be  sure to share your own predictions for  how one piece will end down in the  comments oda has already confirmed that  this is the final saga the end really is  near so now is the best time to talk  about the ending and theorize about it  down in the comments below then when the  series finally does come to an end we  can come back to this video check the  comments and see if any of us were right  if you guys enjoyed this video you know  what to do leave a quick like and  comment it only takes a second but it  helps a lot with that youtube algorithm  and of course if you haven't already  don't forget to subscribe and hit that  notification 